{{Lua|Array}}
Divides a string into a formatted list of substrings.

==Syntax==
* {{F|1}} &mdash; arrayString - the input string, each item separated by {{F|2}}.
* {{F|2}} &mdash; separator - the character or substring to split on.
* {{F|3}} &mdash; format - the resulting format of each substring.
* {{F|4}} &mdash; join (optional) - separator between each element to join. Default no separator.
** {{F|{item} }} is replaced with the item.
** {{F|{newline} }} is replaced with a newline.
** {{F|{index} }} is replaced with the index.
* {{F|sort}} &mdash; (optional) set to 1 to sort the items in the array in ascending order, -1 for descending.
* {{F|dedupe}} &mdash; (optional) set to 1 to remove duplicate items from array.
* {{F|noTrim}} &mdash; (optional) set to 1 to not remove whitespace from items in the array.
* {{F|removeEmpty}} &mdash; (optional) set to 1 to remove empty items from array.
* {{F|sentence}} &mdash; (optional) set to 1 to display as sentence.
** {{F|sentence_join}} &mdash; (optional) join character. Default {{F|,}}
** {{F|sentence_last}} &mdash; (optional) last item join word. Default {{F| and }}
* {{F|prefix}} &mdash; (optional) text added to start of result.
* {{F|suffix}} &mdash; (optional) text added to end of result.
* {{F|template}} &mdash; (optional) set to 1 to allow escaped template syntax for complex returns
** escape {{F|<nowiki>{{</nowiki>}} as: {{F|²{}} or {{F|^2{}}.
** escape {{F|<nowiki>}}</nowiki>}} as: {{F|}²}} or {{F|}^2}}.
** escape {{F|<nowiki>|</nowiki>}} as: {{F|¦}} or {{F|¹}}.

==Examples==
{{T|Array|1,2,3,4,5|,|P3=*'&#39;{item}'&#39;{newline}&nbsp;}} yields: {{Array|1,2,3,4,5|,|*''{item}''{newline} }}<br>
{{T|Array|1,2,2,2,3,4,5|,|*''{item}''{newline}|dedupe=1|_Y_=1}}<br>
{{T|Array|Mafumafu;Amatsuki;96Neko;Mizushino Yuu;Melt da Tenshi;Coe.|;|*{item}{newline}|sort=1|_Y_=1}}<br>
{{T|Array|Archon;Story;Event|;|[[{item} Quests]]|XXX|_Y_=1}}<br>
{{T|Array|p1=Archon Quest;Story Quest;World Quest|p2=;|p3=[[{item}]]s|p4=sentence=1|p5=prefix=There are&#32;|p6=suffix=&#32;to complete.|_Y_=1|block=1}}<br>
{{T|Array|a&&b&&c&&d&&e|&&|{index}: {item}|,&nbsp;|_Y_=1}}<br>
{{T|Array|Mafumafu;Amatsuki;96Neko;Mizushino Yuu;Melt da Tenshi;Coe.|;|P3=3={{T|Character|{item}|50|NC=1}}|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Array|Placed,Potato,Equipment|,|p3=3=²{#switch:{item}¦Equipment¦Quick Use¦Placed¦Inventory=[[:Category:{item} Gadgets]]¦#default=invalid}²|p4=$$|p5=template=1|block=1|_Y_=1}}<br>

